  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e42d35cd0785dbd",
      "translationZh": "我想看看我的完全本地运行的家庭语音助手与最新的 GPT Live 相比表现如何，于是我用他们在“Improved Intelligence”演示中使用的同一段对话进行了测试。在这段视频中，他们让 AI 判断一条航班路线是否可行，并在它分析这件事的同时，继续问它在各个目的地可以吃些什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0faa5356fc885eef",
      "translationZh": "我运行的模型如下（全部塞进了 12 GB VRAM）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a9d49abcd70fdcf",
      "translationZh": "语音识别：Qwen3 1.7B ASR PyTorch",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15bec5bf2697f74f",
      "translationZh": "LLM：Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q4_K_XL GGUF，上下文长度为 12K",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f31e718382b190ba",
      "translationZh": "语音：Pocket TTS PyTorch",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "556e25273b8801fd",
      "translationZh": "于是，我原样复制了这个提问，把它交给了我的 Fulloch 项目。这篇博客文章包含了交互过程的视频，并详细分析了它的表现。最终报告和它执行的搜索也都在那篇博客文章中附有链接。视频中有两段被加速处理，因为当时我得等待 9B 模型完成对任务的思考，但它完成整个过程用时不到六分半钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da8bf6d4fc079de2",
      "translationZh": "最终，它没能找到合适的航班路线，但给出了不错的美食和餐厅推荐，而且整个过程相当迅速。Qwen3.5 9B 模型在资源占用如此小的情况下，处理这类任务还能有这么好的表现，依然让我印象深刻。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f5c7e44307232e7",
      "translationZh": "如果你想亲自试试，可以在 https://github.com/liampetti/fulloch 找到源代码和预编译的 docker 镜像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "442b0e4b5dd47b95",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/liampetti 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
